Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,What if the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.60,0:00:01.54,Cap,,0,0,0,,Panthers and the Ravens
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,were their actual mascots?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.64,0:00:04.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Rip the jerseys!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.94,0:00:06.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Bird versus cat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.48,0:00:08.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,Carolina beat Baltimore
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.52,0:00:10.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,35 to 33.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:12.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,Seven lead changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.04,0:00:13.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,Only one leaves dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:14.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,In this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.16,0:00:15.96,Cap,,0,0,0,,corner, the Ravens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.96,0:00:16.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,Named after Edgar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.08,Cap,,0,0,0,,Allan Poe's poem, because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.08,0:00:19.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,Poe died in Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.88,0:00:20.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ravens are one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.44,0:00:21.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,of the smartest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.10,0:00:22.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,birds on earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,They solve puzzles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.52,0:00:24.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,They remember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,faces for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:26.32,Cap,,0,0,0,,And in this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.32,0:00:28.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,corner, the black panther.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:28.82,Cap,,0,0,0,,Which isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:30.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,even a species.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.14,0:00:30.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's a leopard
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:31.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,or a jaguar
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,in a black coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,And jaguars love water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:35.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,So much for
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.58,0:00:36.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,the rain helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.86,0:00:38.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,The birds start smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.24,0:00:39.16,Cap,,0,0,0,,A safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.16,0:00:39.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:41.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,86-yard kickoff return.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:42.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,Flying the whole way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.74,0:00:43.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then they remember
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.58,0:00:45.20,Cap,,0,0,0,,they don't have hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.20,0:00:47.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,Drop, drop, drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:48.62,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four turnovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:49.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Carolina?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:50.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.14,0:00:51.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,Third quarter: Panthers
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.28,0:00:52.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,10, Ravens zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.58,0:00:54.76,Cap,,0,0,0,,The smartest bird alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.76,0:00:55.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Out-thought by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:56.74,Cap,,0,0,0,,a wet cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.74,0:00:57.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,Field goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.48,0:00:59.22,Cap,,0,0,0,,1:47 left.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.22,0:01:00.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,35–33.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.50,0:01:01.28,Cap,,0,0,0,,One last heave
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.28,0:01:02.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,from the flock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.30,0:01:03.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,And the cat pounces.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:04.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's six straight
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:06.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,losses for Baltimore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:06.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Will the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.58,0:01:08.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Ravens win again?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:08.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Quoth the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.44,Cap,,0,0,0,,raven… Nevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:11.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Comment who wins next.
